OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain across
OL,6,Fthe northwest where it can be windy
OL,7,Fwith some coastal gales. Rain will
OL,8,Fslowly edge southeast, becoming
OL,9,Fincreasingly fragmented. Elsewhere, it
OL,10,Fwill stay dry with variable cloud,
OL,11,Fwhile mist and fog patches may develop
OL,12,Fin the southwest.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FFog and low cloud will clear
OL,15,Ffrom some central and southern areas,
OL,16,Fleaving a warm, dry day for many.
OL,17,FCloudier skies in the north and west
OL,18,Fwill drift southeastwards.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
